<title>USA: CCC seeks U.S. rice and corn blend for N. Korea.</title>
<headline>CCC seeks U.S. rice and corn blend for N. Korea.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp said it was seeking on July 24 a total of 10,000 tonnes of U.S. milled rice in bulk and 5,000 tonnes of corn-soy blend in 25 kg bags for donation to North Korea.</p>
<p>Both commodities were slated for August 25 delivery, according to the CCC which is part of the U.S. Department of Agriculture.</p>
<p>((Doris Frankel 312-983-7305))</p>
